Hermes Agent (https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent) is released
under the MIT License by Nous Research. hermes-safe-update does not include
Hermes Agent source code. It runs the user's own installed copy of Hermes
(its launcher, its bundled Python and its bundled Electron) and reads files
that Hermes writes. Small pieces of text that Hermes prints (progress lines,
a few error messages) are matched as data and listed in
internal/hermes/contracts.go.

